            </note>
            <note corresp="#d925-f3" n="3" xml:id="d925-f3-content">
                <p>Same as telegram 3369 to Vienna, <ref target="#d923">Document 923</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d925-f4" n="4" xml:id="d925-f4-content">
                <p>Telegram 1446 summarized Soviet press reports, including statements about pro-<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Anschluss</hi> propaganda issued by the Austrian
                    Government. (961.61/5–2154)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
